5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... hello everyone. I'm not really sure what to say first, but I hope we can all work together to find the werewolf.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree, Daisuke. Cooperation is key, though we must remain vigilant. I'll be observing everyone's reactions closely to see if anyone seems out of place.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"A very standard start. I'm sure we'll all be ""cooperating"" quite nicely, though some of us are certainly more honest than others. Let's see who cracks first.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not going to crack! I'll find the werewolf no matter what, so just don't get in my way. Let's just get this started.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,Let's keep our emotions in check. Aggression won't help us identify the werewolf; only logical observation and consistent patterns will. I'll be watching for any contradictions in our statements.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'll try my best to be logical too, Ryuji. Does anyone have any initial thoughts or things they've noticed about each other already?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"It's too early for concrete evidence, but I'm curious about the dynamics. Shunichi's sarcasm is expected, but I wonder if Takumi's eagerness is a shield or genuine confidence.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, analyzing the child's psychology already? How clinical. I suspect Takumi is simply being Takumi, but your focus on him is almost too convenient.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Hey! I'm not a ""child"" in this game, I'm a player! And @Victoria is just being careful, which is better than @Shunichi just making snide comments about everyone!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,The bickering is a distraction. We should focus on establishing a baseline for how each person communicates before we start making accusations based on personality traits.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I think Ryuji is right. Maybe we should just... talk more about ourselves? Or maybe we can talk about how we'll decide who to vote for tomorrow?,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"That's a reasonable suggestion, Daisuke. I believe we should prioritize the Seer's information once it becomes available, though we must be careful about who claims that role.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Exactly. A fake Seer is the oldest trick in the book. I'll be very interested to see who tries to ""guide"" us with divine knowledge tomorrow.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,I don't need a special role to find the wolf! I'll just watch everyone's faces and catch them in a lie. I'm not falling for any tricks!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Confidence is a useful tool, Takumi, but intuition alone is a gamble. We need a system for verifying claims to ensure the werewolf doesn't manipulate the group's trust.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with Ryuji. I'll do my best to be careful and think things through. I hope we can all survive the first night.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Victoria,,"I hope so too, Daisuke. Let's all try to stay focused and remember that the first few days are the most critical for gathering information. Good luck to everyone.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Good luck indeed. I'll be enjoying the show as the masks start to slip. Until tomorrow, then.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm not wearing a mask! I'm just me! Just you wait—I'll be the one to save us all tomorrow!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,"Let's see if that confidence holds up when the first result is revealed. Sleep well, everyone.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
