31,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... good morning. I... I have some information. I'm the Seer, and I checked Ryuji last night. He... he is the werewolf.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"That was a very bold and direct start, Daisuke. If you are telling the truth, we've found the werewolf immediately, but we must consider if this is a strategic move by the wolf to frame Ryuji.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Oh, how convenient. The shyest member of our group suddenly finds his voice to point a finger on the very first turn. It's almost too perfect, isn't it?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I don't care if it's ""too perfect""! Daisuke is just being honest! If he says Ryuji is the wolf, then Ryuji is the wolf! Right, Ryuji? Say something!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I am a villager. Daisuke is either mistaken or, more likely, the werewolf attempting to eliminate me immediately by claiming a role he doesn't possess. It's a classic aggressive play.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm not lying! I... I really did check him! I'm scared, but I have to tell you the truth because if we don't vote for Ryuji now, he'll just kill more of us tonight!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"If Daisuke is the Seer, we cannot afford to ignore this. However, if Ryuji is a villager, we are executing an innocent. @Shunichi, you seem skeptical; do you have a reason other than Daisuke's personality?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Not a specific reason, just a pattern. The werewolf often hides behind a facade of vulnerability to gain trust. Daisuke's sudden ""bravery"" is a bit too theatrical for my liking.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Stop talking about ""patterns"" and ""theatricals""! Daisuke is shaking because he's terrified, not because he's acting! Ryuji is the one being too calm, like he's just calculating how to lie to us!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Calmness is a trait of a rational person, Takumi, not necessarily a liar. If I were the werewolf, would I really be this transparent? Daisuke's claim is a gamble that relies entirely on your emotional reactions.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm not gambling! I just... I saw the result! Please, believe me! If you don't vote for Ryuji, he's just going to kill us one by one! I can't let that happen!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I see the desperation in your voice, Daisuke, and it feels genuine. However, we must weigh this against Ryuji's consistency. If we execute Ryuji and he's innocent, we lose a rational mind. But if we wait, we risk another death.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's be honest, Victoria, ""rationality"" is the perfect cover for a wolf. Ryuji is playing the part of the stoic observer perfectly. But then again, Daisuke's sudden transformation is equally suspicious. It's a toss-up between two very different styles of deception.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Ryuji"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"It's not a toss-up! Daisuke is the Seer! Why are you guys making this so hard? If we don't vote Ryuji out now, we're just letting the wolf win! I'm voting for Ryuji!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"If you all follow Takumi's blind impulse, you are playing right into the werewolf's hands. I urge you to consider the risk of executing a confirmed human based on the word of someone who has provided no proof.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't have proof other than my word! But I'm telling the truth! Please, I'm begging you, just trust me this once so we can be safe!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"I've listened to everyone, and while the risk is high, Daisuke's distress seems too authentic to be a calculated act. I believe we should trust the Seer's divination and vote for Ryuji.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Well, if Victoria is swayed by a few tears, I suppose the tide has turned. I still find the timing suspicious, but I'll go with the majority to see if the result proves us right or foolish.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"Finally! I knew you guys would come around! Ryuji, you're done for! I'm voting for you, and I'm glad everyone else is finally waking up!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"It is a pity that you prioritize emotion over evidence. You are making a grave mistake, and you will realize the cost of this decision when the night falls again.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
